(* LaTeX (L261-263): v_2^2=\frac{1}{1-c_{13}},\qquad v_1^2=\frac{2c_1-c_1^2+c_3^2}{2c_{14}(1-c_{13})},\\
          v_0^2=\frac{c_{123}(2-c_{14})}{c_{14}(1-c_{13})(2+c_{13}+3c_2)}.
   This section checks only the v0 ARITHMETIC: v0^2 as quoted is positive for the couplings used, v0 = 1 at the base
