(* LaTeX (L277-278): "bounds the spin-2 speed and hence $|c_{13}|\lesssim10^{-15}$".  The bound itself is an
   observational input.  Check: the step from the speed to c13 is v2 - 1 = c13/2 + O(c13^2) from eq:speeds, so
