(*10. eq:lapse (L309-312) and inline u_a=-N nabla_a t (L304)*)


(* LaTeX (L310): a_i=D_i\ln N ,\qquad a^a\equiv u^b\nabla_b u^a;  (L304) $u_a=-N\nabla_a t$.
