   the code's Theta equation d_t Theta = beta Theta' + N Theta (Q/2 - trK/3).  Also: a_b contains only d_r N. *)
res14 = Flatten[{Dl + Kab + Outer[Times, uLo, accLo], Kab - Transpose[Kab], Kab . uUp, divu + trKM,
    KththM + (D[Thf[t, r], t] - betaf[t, r] D[Thf[t, r], r])/(Nf[t, r] Thf[t, r]),
    D[Thf[t, r], t] - (betaf[t, r] D[Thf[t, r], r] + Nf[t, r] Thf[t, r] (QM/2 - trKM/3))}];
