     Table[D[rhs[[i]] /. {Derivative[0, 1][trk][t, r] -> dK, Derivative[0, 1][arf][t, r] -> dA}, v], {i, {1, 2, 3}}, {v, {dK, dA}}]};
];
report["S36 eq:evolution block-triangular", "755-761,348-353", "trK, a_r lines of eq:evolution == code RHS; Theta, psi, P equations free of d_r trK, d_r a_r", isZeroAll[res36], res36];


