   "$|F_\psi|\lesssim0.02$, against \ae ther-flux peaks of $0.9$--$4$" (L1020-1021); caption spheres 40, 100, 200 (L1027).
   Simulation output; the caption spheres lie in the quoted range (arithmetic only). *)
